<p>A long-distance train struck the rear carriage of a stopped commuter train late Monday at Bekasi Timur station, east of Jakarta, killing at least 15 people and injuring 88, later reports citing Indonesian officials and rescuers said. Earlier accounts from PT Kereta Api Indonesia and rescue officials put the toll at 14 dead and 84 injured while crews were still working through mangled carriages. The impact hit a women-only carriage on the commuter train, and officials said all the dead were women. Police and transport authorities were investigating the cause. Rescue teams completed the evacuation Tuesday after an overnight operation, National Search and Rescue Agency head Mohammad Syafii said. President Prabowo Subianto ordered an investigation into the collision.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/azidH8t-2gZfJR0vpg9WDEQFBoyA_HjAnw7GQyjSVxsBAK_uxO333gWQB0ES74N-L_NQEeBwBWCHGpKKIMnJ6prJf4kchTzkm9OT7DW-iuTSJiff7mwgwWq6b8cSSeQkiqCkOuavdycjcTUYxgQTxKikOVi1Hzf_1oiC6KHqoxTN3hC-CfQxq2Qp30QZoAm0V73R94Txpkwm5xt-q_OB9syXK50KEnZn8xd0AlqhJMPdT00qB1ezxEH0ce90FI8y0jo7X3l7WqA' alt='Technicians at the site after a deadly collision between a commuter line train and a long-distance train in Bekasi on the outskirts of Jakarta, Indonesia, on April 28, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Train passengers: Officials said all 240 passengers aboard the Argo Bromo Anggrek long-distance train were safe after the collision.</li><li>Hospital triage: Basarnas&#x27; preliminary figures separated survivors who received hospital care from those discharged with minor injuries.</li><li>Survivor accounts: Herman Susanto and Dwi Aksan told SCMP they were in the third carriage of a packed commuter train from Jakarta to Cikarang after a long workday.</li></ul><blockquote>I thought I was going to die - Sausan Sarifah</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Prabowo Subianto: Geo reported he visited victims after the crash. (<a href='https://www.geo.tv/latest/661919-14-killed-84-injured-as-two-trains-collided-in-indonesia'>Geo</a>)</li><li>PT Kereta Api Indonesia: Chief executive Bobby Rasyidin said a taxi on the tracks was hit by the commuter train before the long-distance train hit the commuter train&#x27;s women-only carriage. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/indonesia-train-crash-death-toll-updates/article70914646.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>National Search and Rescue Agency: Mohammad Syafii said no more passengers remained to be found, though rescuers would respond if body parts were discovered while they combed through the wreckage. (<a href='https://www.brecorder.com/news/40418619/indonesia-train-crash-toll-rises-to-14-as-rescuers-complete-evacuation'>Business Recorder</a>)</li><li>Sausan Sarifah: The injured passenger said people were ready to get off the commuter train when they heard the locomotive, then passengers were piled up and crushed inside the carriage. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1995728/train-collision-kills-14-injures-dozens-near-jakarta'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/28/indonesian-train-crash-fatal'>Train collision in Indonesia kills 14 as rescuers work to reach survivors</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/officials-death-toll-train-crash-indonesias-capital-risen-132442130'>Officials say the death toll in a train crash outside Indonesia&#x27;s capital has risen to 14</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/indonesia-many-killed-in-train-collision-near-jakarta/a-76959000'>Indonesia: Many killed in train collision near Jakarta</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/ckgegg8r0v1o'>Rescuers race to free survivors trapped inside train after fatal Indonesia crash</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/28/world/asia/indonesia-train-crash.html'>Trains Collide in Indonesia, Killing at Least 14 and Injuring Dozens</a> - nytime